       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-EXTERIOR-CALCULUS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EXTERIOR-CALCULUS-PROOFS.
           05  WS-NILPOTENCY-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HODGE-DUAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LAPLACE-DERHAM-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CALCULUS-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EXTERIOR-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-EXTERIOR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-EXT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-EXT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-NILPOTENCY-AND-HODGE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-DERHAM-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-EXT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-NILPOTENCY-AND-HODGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NILPOTENCY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HODGE-DUAL-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-DERHAM-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LAPLACE-DERHAM-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CALCULUS-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-EXT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-NILPOTENCY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HODGE-DUAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LAPLACE-DERHAM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CALCULUS-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-EXTERIOR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-EXT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-EXT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-EXT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-EXT-CODE.
